        "read": false,
        "user_title": "",
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hello all, I just bought the game and read the rules.&nbsp; I haven&#39;t played yet.&nbsp; I did have a couple of questions which the FAQ addresses (thanks, Eric!), but couldn&#39;t find the answer to one:</p><p>One of the options to lower the difficulty even below the starting assumptions is to skip the initial Explore step during setup.&nbsp; But as near as I can tell from a reading, wouldn&#39;t that mean the spirits win instantly?&nbsp; Without that, there are no invaders of any type on the island, and at fear level 1, that&#39;s the win condition.&nbsp; What am I missing?</p>",
