        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-06-19T14:35:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, every board starts with a Town and a City&nbsp; - the Town is always in an Inland land and the City is always the middle of the three Coastal lands on each board - all four boards are laid out in such a way that there will <em>always</em> be two Explorers added per board in the initial setup.</p>",
